    "url": "https://www.facebook.com/lgucabanatuan/posts/pfbid0G1phVxVRTy1nVGti1LNrpYoQoERxUXFsD4fFgQXSg9KqQ1mFezLGuXSmWdf59P8nl",
    "creation_time": 1743469112,
    "text": "𝗧𝗼𝗱𝗮𝘆 𝗪𝗲 𝗖𝗲𝗹𝗲𝗯𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗲 : 𝗘𝗶𝗱 𝗔𝗹-𝗙𝗶𝘁𝗿 \n𝗠𝗮𝗿𝗰𝗵 𝟯𝟭, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱 - 𝗔𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗹 𝟬𝟭, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱\n\nThe City Government of Cabanatuan extends its warmest greetings to our Muslim community on the occasion of Eid al-Fitr. May this day of celebration bring peace, joy, and prosperity to all. Let us continue to uphold the values of unity, compassion, and gratitude. Eid Mubarak!",
